[
    {
        "content": "<p>I am working on Exercise 3.1.2 and using <code>nth_rw</code>, but I am confused about how it works.</p>\n<p>In my goal there are two occurrences of <code>empty</code>, but <code>nth_rw 1</code> rewrites the second one. Why is the second <code>empty</code> considered index 1?</p>\n<p>Could someone explain how the indexing in <code>nth_rw</code> works?</p>\n<p><img alt=\"image.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"2592x486\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/pxQYpOfutSbzhKjfwNjj7Rfe/image.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/pxQYpOfutSbzhKjfwNjj7Rfe/image.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
        "id": 579588599,
        "sender_full_name": "Lingwei Peng (彭灵伟)",
        "timestamp": 1773621109
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think that this is because the <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\in Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span> notation expands to <code>Y x</code>! What happens if you change 1 to 2?</p>",
        "id": 579590200,
        "sender_full_name": "Kevin Buzzard",
        "timestamp": 1773622291
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><code>x ∈ Y</code> stands for <code>Membership.mem Y x</code>, so the first one is actually the second one</p>",
        "id": 579590504,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1773622529
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thanks! I had forgotten about that detail. This makes sense now.</p>",
        "id": 579592573,
        "sender_full_name": "Lingwei Peng (彭灵伟)",
        "timestamp": 1773623315
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Yes, you are right.<br>\n<img alt=\"image.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"2780x464\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/D2Cy1YtbzAZdqXcikXMRT4n7/image.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/D2Cy1YtbzAZdqXcikXMRT4n7/image.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
